Z||000035||Sage||01-20-2000||12:32 AM||||Each one of ours was an adventure, as they all to be "fixed" before they could be used. Except the Silver 86GT, and by that time, it didn't bother me to put one together!  Have had many vehicles over the years, but none that were as much fun to drive as the fieros.  The Triumphs were close, but after rebuilding a couple of them, I much prefer the way the Fiero is put together.  RossT looks like you and I kinda like the same thing&gt; <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87gt.jpg">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
